# Reserved local port block for radius-todolist-app.
# Many projects run on this machine at once; do not use default ports
# (3000, 5000, 8000, 8080, 8081, 1234, 10000).
#
# Note: port 10000 appears in this project only as the *remote* Azure Managed
# Redis port. Nothing binds it locally.
